      {
        "detail": 0,
        "format": 0,
        "mode": "normal",
        "style": "",
        "text": "Amendment 87 is the single-most important measure in the state’s history to make Colorado’s income tax and overall budget more progressive and fair for everyone. As we get deeper into Amendment 87, I must mention that if you support this measure, you must also vote against Proposition 136, which would prevent the law from taking effect.",
